  "grammar_observation": {
    "target_language": "Es i allan; aeth Dafi allan. Des i yn ôl; daeth Sam yn ôl. Gwnes i lun; gwnaeth Mali lun. Ces i'r allwedd; cafodd Iwan yr allwedd.",
    "bridge_language": "The first form in each pair reports what I did; the second reports what another person did. These very common simple-past forms are irregular and are best learned as pairs."
  },
